#: includes/section/report/botblocker-report-dashboard.php:19
#| msgid ""
#| "You can create custom blocking rules based on any property shown in the "
#| "report. For example, you can block a specific IP address, country, or "
#| "device type if they appear suspicious. This gives you flexibility and "
#| "full control over your website's security, allowing you to respond "
#| "promptly to new threats."
msgid ""
"You can create custom blocking rules based on any property shown in the "
"report. For example, you can block a specific IP address, country, or device "
"type if they appear suspicious. This gives you flexibility and full control "
"over your website’s security, allowing you to respond promptly to new "
"threats."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez créer des règles de blocage personnalisées basées sur n'importe "
"quelle propriété affichée dans le rapport. Par exemple, vous pouvez bloquer "
"une adresse IP spécifique, un pays ou un type d'appareil s'ils semblent "
"suspects. Cela vous donne une flexibilité et un contrôle total sur la "
"sécurité de votre site web, vous permettant de répondre rapidement aux "
"nouvelles menaces."

#: includes/section/tools/botblocker-tools-maintenance.php:19
